      "note": [
        "Exchange funds and transfer funds are collected for the first time in 2019. External funding sources are divided in to exchange funds and transfer funds. Internal funding sources are self-financing, government appropriations and grants.",
        "Statistics on regional allocation of R&D expenditure for the local and regional R&D units are unavailable prior to the reference year 2023.",
        "From the reference year 2023, the sub-sector local and regional R&D units is made up of associations of local authorities.",
        "Statistics on intramural R&D expenditure allocated by source of funds for local and regional R&D units are unavailable prior to the reference year 2023.",
        "Statistics on intramural R&D expenditure allocated by source of funds for government agencies are unavailable at the regional level.",
        "Statistics on intramural R&D expenditure allocated by source of funds for public non-profit organisations are not as detailed as for the other sub-sectors."
